meta {
  name: Get By ID - Details
  type: http
  seq: 21
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/job/JOB_UUID/details
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  ## Get Job Details — Protected (Owner or Admin)

  Returns a single job by UUID with all non-deleted statuses visible.
  Does NOT increment the view counter.
  Used for the job edit page and other owner/admin views.

  Replace `JOB_UUID` with the actual job ID.

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "...",
      "title": "...",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "owner": { ... },
      "category": { ... }
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error Response (404)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "error": "Job not found"
  }
  ```
}
